  Content: A Japanese anime following exchange student Juuto Maruizawa and his battles
    against the oppressive student council, who try to have Juuto expelled. The series
    was canceled partway after the production studio, Studio Spin, went bankrupt,
    airing only 10 of the planned 12 episodes. Since the original show run, several
    well known speculative endings (largely fan created) have been released, which
    have cemented the series as a cult hit.
